</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="14" id="mwAWY" aria-labelledby="North_sector"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="North_sector">North sector</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_neighbourhoods_in_Edmonton&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14" title="Edit section: North sector"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwAWc">Edmonton's suburban north sector is bounded by 142 Street to the west, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sturgeon_County" title="Sturgeon County" id="mwAWg">Sturgeon County</a> including <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CFB_Edmonton" title="CFB Edmonton" id="mwAWk">CFB Edmonton</a> to the north, and 66 Street to the east. Its southern boundary is formed by 137 Avenue and 153 Avenue west and east of 97 Street (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alberta_Highway_28" title="Alberta Highway 28" id="mwAWo">Highway 28</a>) respectively.<sup about="#mwt139" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-5" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwAWs"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAWw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAW0">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAW4">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<section data-mw-section-id="15" id="mwAW8" aria-labelledby="Castle_Downs"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Castle_Downs">Castle Downs</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_neighbourhoods_in_Edmonton&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15" title="Edit section: Castle Downs"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt140" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAXA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Main article","href":"./Template:Main_article"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Castle Downs, Edmonton"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237" about="#mwt141" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Hatnote/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt140" id="mwAXE">Main article: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castle_Downs,_Edmonton" title="Castle Downs, Edmonton">Castle Downs, Edmonton</a></div>
<p id="mwAXI">Castle Downs, including Castle Downs Extension, is located in the central portion of Edmonton's north sector.<sup about="#mwt142" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-6" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwAXM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAXQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAXU">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAXY">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt145" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Plans_19-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Plans"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Plans-19"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Plans-19" id="mwAXc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAXg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAXk">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAXo">]</span></span></a></sup> The area is bounded by 127 Street to the west and Anthony Henday Drive (Highway 216) to the north.<sup about="#mwt146" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Plans_19-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Plans"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Plans-19" id="mwAXs"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAXw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAX0">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAX4">]</span></span></a></sup> To the east, it is bounded by 97 Street to the north of 153 Avenue and Castle Downs Road (113A Street) to the south of 153 Avenue.<sup about="#mwt147" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Plans_19-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Plans"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Plans-19" id="mwAX8"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAYA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAYE">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAYI">]</span></span></a></sup> To the south, it is bounded by 137 Avenue to the west of Castle Downs Road and 153 Avenue to the east of Castle Downs Road.<sup about="#mwt148" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Plans_19-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Plans"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Plans-19" id="mwAYM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAYQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAYU">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAYY">]</span></span></a></sup> The following 11 neighbourhoods comprise Castle Downs.<sup about="#mwt149" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-14" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwAYc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAYg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAYk">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAYo">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
