<p id="mwAZA">Lake District, also known as Edmonton North, is located in the eastern portion of Edmonton's north sector.<sup about="#mwt158" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-7" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwAZE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAZI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAZM">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAZQ">]</span></span></a></sup> The area is bounded by 97 Street (Highway 28) to the west, Anthony Henday Drive (Highway 216) to the north, 66 Street to the east and 153 Avenue to the south.<sup about="#mwt161" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-ENASP_20-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"ENASP"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-ENASP-20"}}'><a href="#cite_note-ENASP-20" id="mwAZU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAZY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAZc">[</span>20<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAZg">]</span></span></a></sup> The following nine neighbourhoods comprise Lake District.<sup about="#mwt162" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-15" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwAZk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAZo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAZs">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAZw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
