<p id="mwAbI">Other neighbourhoods within Edmonton's north sector not within larger residential areas include <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goodridge_Corners,_Edmonton" title="Goodridge Corners, Edmonton" id="mwAbM">Goodridge Corners</a>
and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Griesbach,_Edmonton" title="Griesbach, Edmonton" id="mwAbQ">Griesbach</a>.<sup about="#mwt183" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-9" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwAbU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAbY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAbc">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAbg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="19" id="mwAbk" aria-labelledby="Northeast_sector"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Northeast_sector">Northeast sector</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_neighbourhoods_in_Edmonton&amp;action=edit&amp;section=19" title="Edit section: Northeast sector"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwAbo">Edmonton's suburban northeast sector is generally bounded by 66 Street and CFB Edmonton within Sturgeon County to the west, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alberta_Highway_37" title="Alberta Highway 37" id="mwAbs">Highway 37</a> to the north, 33 Street NE to the northeast, the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Saskatchewan_River" title="North Saskatchewan River" id="mwAbw">North Saskatchewan River</a> to the east and southeast, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yellowhead_Trail" title="Yellowhead Trail" id="mwAb0">Yellowhead Trail</a> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alberta_Highway_16" title="Alberta Highway 16" id="mwAb4">Highway 16</a>) to the south. Its southwestern boundary is formed by portions of a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canadian_National" title="Canadian National" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAb8">Canadian National</a> (CN) rail line, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fort_Road,_Edmonton" title="Fort Road, Edmonton" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAcA">Fort Road</a>, 50 Street and 144 Avenue.<sup about="#mwt184" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-10" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwAcE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAcI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAcM">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAcQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<section data-mw-section-id="20" id="mwAcU" aria-labelledby="Casselman-Steele_Heights_2"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Casselman-Steele_Heights_2">Casselman-Steele Heights</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_neighbourhoods_in_Edmonton&amp;action=edit&amp;section=20" title="Edit section: Casselman-Steele Heights"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt185" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAcY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Main article","href":"./Template:Main_article"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Casselman-Steele Heights, Edmonton"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237" about="#mwt186" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Hatnote/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt185" id="mwAcc">Main article: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Casselman-Steele_Heights,_Edmonton" title="Casselman-Steele Heights, Edmonton">Casselman-Steele Heights, Edmonton</a></div>
<p id="mwAcg">The majority of Casselman-Steele Heights is located in the southwest portion of Edmonton's northeast sector.<sup about="#mwt187" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-11" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwAck"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAco"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAcs">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAcw">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt188" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Plans_19-4" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Plans"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Plans-19" id="mwAc0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAc4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAc8">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAdA">]</span></span></a></sup> The area is bounded by 66 Street to the west, 153 Avenue to the north, a Canadian National rail line to the east and 137 Avenue to the south.<sup about="#mwt189" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-CSHOP_18-4" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"CSHOP"}}'><a href="#cite_note-CSHOP-18" id="mwAdE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAdI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAdM">[</span>18<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAdQ">]</span></span></a></sup> The portion of the area south of 144 Avenue and west of 50 Street, the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/York,_Edmonton" title="York, Edmonton" id="mwAdU">York</a> neighbourhood,<sup about="#mwt190" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-17" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwAdY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAdc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAdg">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAdk">]</span></span></a></sup> is located outside the northeast sector in the adjacent mature area sector.<sup about="#mwt191" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-12" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwAdo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAds"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAdw">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAd0">]</span></span></a></sup> The following four neighbourhoods comprise the northeast sector portion of Casselman-Steele Heights.<sup about="#mwt192" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-18" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwAd4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAd8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAeA">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAeE">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
