</section><section data-mw-section-id="21" id="mwAeQ" aria-labelledby="Clareview"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Clareview">Clareview</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_neighbourhoods_in_Edmonton&amp;action=edit&amp;section=21" title="Edit section: Clareview"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt199" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAeU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Main article","href":"./Template:Main_article"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Clareview, Edmonton"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237" about="#mwt200" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Hatnote/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span><div role="note" class="hatnote navigation-not-searchable" about="#mwt199" id="mwAeY">Main article: <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clareview,_Edmonton" title="Clareview, Edmonton">Clareview, Edmonton</a></div>
<p id="mwAec">Clareview is located in the south-central portion of Edmonton's northeast sector.<sup about="#mwt201" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-13" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwAeg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAek"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAeo">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAes">]</span></span></a></sup> The area is generally bounded by a Canadian National rail line to the west, a power line right-of-way to the north of 153 Avenue to the north, the North Saskatchewan River valley and 18 Street to the east, and 130 Avenue and the Kennedale Ravine to the south.<sup about="#mwt204" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-COP_22-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"COP"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-COP-22"}}'><a href="#cite_note-COP-22" id="mwAew"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAe0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAe4">[</span>22<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAe8">]</span></span></a></sup> The following eight neighbourhoods comprise Clareview.<sup about="#mwt205" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-19" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwAfA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAfE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAfI">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAfM">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
