<p id="mwAhI">Horse Hill is located in the northeast portion of Edmonton's northeast sector.<sup about="#mwt228" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-15" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwAhM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAhQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhU">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhY">]</span></span></a></sup> The area is bounded by Manning Drive (Highway 15) to the northwest, Anthony Henday Drive (Highway 216) to the southwest, the North Saskatchewan River valley to the south and east, and 33 Street NE to the northeast.<sup about="#mwt231" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-24" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-24"}}'><a href="#cite_note-24" id="mwAhc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAhg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAhk">[</span>24<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAho">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
