<p id="mwAiA">Pilot Sound is located in the north-central portion of Edmonton's northeast sector.<sup about="#mwt240" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-16" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwAiE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAiI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAiM">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAiQ">]</span></span></a></sup> The area is bounded by 66 Street to the west, Anthony Henday Drive (Highway 216) to the north and northeast and 153 Avenue to the south.<sup about="#mwt243" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-PSASP_25-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"PSASP"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-PSASP-25"}}'><a href="#cite_note-PSASP-25" id="mwAiU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAiY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAic">[</span>25<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAig">]</span></span></a></sup> The following six neighbourhoods comprise Pilot Sound.<sup about="#mwt244" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-21" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwAik"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAio"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAis">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAiw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
