<p id="mwAlU"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westview_Village,_Edmonton" title="Westview Village, Edmonton" id="mwAlY">Westview Village</a> is a residential neighbourhood within Edmonton's northwest sector that is not within a larger residential area.<sup about="#mwt267" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-23" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwAlc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAlg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAlk">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAlo">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="28" id="mwAls" aria-labelledby="Southeast_sector"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Southeast_sector">Southeast sector</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_neighbourhoods_in_Edmonton&amp;action=edit&amp;section=28" title="Edit section: Southeast sector"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwAlw">Edmonton's suburban southeast sector is generally bounded by 34 Street and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sherwood_Park_Freeway" title="Sherwood Park Freeway" id="mwAl0">Sherwood Park Freeway</a> (Highway 100) to the northeast, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anthony_Henday_Drive" title="Anthony Henday Drive" id="mwAl4">Anthony Henday Drive</a> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Strathcona_County" title="Strathcona County" id="mwAl8">Strathcona County</a>) to the east, 41 Avenue SW (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leduc_County" title="Leduc County" id="mwAmA">Leduc County</a>) to the south, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gateway_Boulevard" title="Gateway Boulevard" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAmE">Gateway Boulevard</a> (Highway 2) to the west, and 63 Avenue/Argyll Road to the northwest. Its northern boundary is formed by portions of 75 Street, 76 Avenue, 71 Street, 82 Avenue, 50 Street and 101 Avenue.<sup about="#mwt268" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-19" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwAmI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAmM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAmQ">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAmU">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<section data-mw-section-id="29" id="mwAmY" aria-labelledby="Decoteau"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Decoteau">Decoteau</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_neighbourhoods_in_Edmonton&amp;action=edit&amp;section=29" title="Edit section: Decoteau"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
