<p id="mwAmk">Decoteau is located in the southeast portion of Edmonton's southeast sector.<sup about="#mwt271" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-20" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwAmo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAms"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAmw">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAm0">]</span></span></a></sup> The area is bounded by 50 Street SW to the west, 41 Avenue SW to the south, Meridian Street to the east, and a combination of Ellerslie Road, 34 Street SW and Anthony Henday Drive to the north.<sup about="#mwt274" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Meltwater_NSP_27-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Meltwater NSP"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Meltwater_NSP-27"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Meltwater_NSP-27" id="mwAm4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAm8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAnA">[</span>27<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAnE">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt277" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Meltwater_NSPD_28-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Meltwater NSPD"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Meltwater_NSPD-28"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Meltwater_NSPD-28" id="mwAnI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAnM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAnQ">[</span>28<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAnU">]</span></span></a></sup> The following five neighbourhoods comprise Decoteau:<sup about="#mwt280" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-29" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-29"}}'><a href="#cite_note-29" id="mwAnY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAnc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAng">[</span>29<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAnk">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
