<p id="mwAn8">Ellerslie is located in the southwest portion of Edmonton's southeast sector.<sup about="#mwt289" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-21" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwAoA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAoE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAoI">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAoM">]</span></span></a></sup> The area is bounded by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gateway_Boulevard" title="Gateway Boulevard" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAoQ">Gateway Boulevard</a> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alberta_Highway_2" title="Alberta Highway 2" id="mwAoU">Highway 2</a>) to the west, Anthony Henday Drive (Highway 216) to the north, 66 Street to the east and 41 Avenue SW to the south.<sup about="#mwt292" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-EllerslieASP_30-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"EllerslieASP"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-EllerslieASP-30"}}'><a href="#cite_note-EllerslieASP-30" id="mwAoY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAoc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAog">[</span>30<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAok">]</span></span></a></sup> The following five neighbourhoods comprise Ellerslie.<sup about="#mwt293" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-24" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwAoo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAos"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAow">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAo0">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
