<p id="mwApM">The Meadows is located in the eastern portion of Edmonton's southeast sector.<sup about="#mwt302" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-22" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwApQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwApU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwApY">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwApc">]</span></span></a></sup> The area is bounded by 34 Street to the west, Whitemud Drive to the north and Anthony Henday Drive (Highway 216) to the east and south.<sup about="#mwt305" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-MeadowsASP_31-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"MeadowsASP"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-MeadowsASP-31"}}'><a href="#cite_note-MeadowsASP-31" id="mwApg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwApk"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwApo">[</span>31<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAps">]</span></span></a></sup> The following seven neighbourhoods comprise The Meadows.<sup about="#mwt306" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-25" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwApw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAp0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAp4">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAp8">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
