<p id="mwAqU">Mill Woods is located in the central portion of Edmonton's southeast sector.<sup about="#mwt315" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-23" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwAqY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAqc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAqg">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAqk">]</span></span></a></sup> The area is bounded by 91 Street to the west, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whitemud_Drive" title="Whitemud Drive" id="mwAqo">Whitemud Drive</a> to the north, 34 Street to the east and Anthony Henday Drive (Highway 216) to the south.<sup about="#mwt318" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-MWDC_32-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"MWDC"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-MWDC-32"}}'><a href="#cite_note-MWDC-32" id="mwAqs"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAqw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAq0">[</span>32<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAq4">]</span></span></a></sup> Excluding the recreational neighbourhoods of Mill Woods Golf Course and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mill_Woods_Park" title="Mill Woods Park" id="mwAq8">Mill Woods Park</a>, Mill Woods includes the following 24 neighbourhoods clustered within 9 communities.<sup about="#mwt319" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-26" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwArA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwArE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwArI">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwArM">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt320" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-MWDC_32-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"MWDC"}}'><a href="#cite_note-MWDC-32" id="mwArQ"><span class=