<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt325" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwArw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"col-begin","href":"./Template:Col-begin"},"params":{},"i":0}},"\n",{"template":{"target":{"wt":"col-3","href":"./Template:Col-3"},"params":{},"i":1}},"\n\n==== Burnewood ====\n",{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Main article","href":"./Template:Main_article"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Burnewood, Edmonton"}},"i":2}},"\nThe Burnewood community comprises the following two neighbourhoods in the northeast portion of Mill Woods bounded by 50 Street to the west, Whitemud Drive to the north, 34 Street to the east and Mill Creek to the southwest.&lt;ref name=wardsnbhds/>&lt;ref name=MWDC/>&lt;ref name=EFCL/>\n*[[Jackson Heights, Edmonton|Jackson Heights]]\n*[[Kiniski Gardens, Edmonton|Kiniski Gardens]]\n",{"template":{"target":{"wt":"col-3","href":"./Template:Col-3"},"params":{},"i":3}},"\n\n==== Knottwood ====\n",{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Main article","href":"./Template:Main_article"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Knottwood, Edmonton"}},"i":4}},"\nThe Knottwood community comprises the following three neighbourhoods in the southwest portion of Mill Woods bounded by 91 Street to the west, 23 Avenue to the north, 66 Street to the east and Anthony Henday Drive to the south.&lt;ref name=wardsnbhds/>&lt;ref name=MWDC/>&lt;ref name=EFCL/>\n*[[Ekota]]\n*[[Menisa]]\n*[[Satoo]]\n",{"template":{"target":{"wt":"col-3","href":"./Template:Col-3"},"params":{},"i":5}},"\n\n==== Lakewood ====\n",{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Main article","href":"./Template:Main_article"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Lakewood, Edmonton"}},"i":6}},"\nThe Lakewood community comprises the following three neighbourhoods in the west portion of Mill Woods bounded by 91 Street to the west, 34 Avenue to the north, 66 Street to the east and 23 Avenue to the south, excluding [[Mill Woods Park]] south of 28 Avenue and east of Mill Woods Road.&lt;ref name=wardsnbhds/>&lt;ref name=MWDC/>&lt;ref name=EFCL/>\n*[[Kameyose