ca&amp;prox=page&amp;rorder=750&amp;rprox=250&amp;rdfreq=0&amp;rwfreq=0&amp;rlead=750&amp;rdepth=0&amp;sufs=0&amp;order=r&amp;cq=&amp;id=50925eda2d | title=Tweddle Place Neighbourhood Profile | publisher=City of Edmonton | access-date=2012-12-04}}&lt;/ref> in the northwest portion of Mill Woods bounded by 91 Street to the west, Whitemud Drive to the north, 66 Street to the east and 34 Avenue to the south.&lt;ref name=wardsnbhds/>&lt;ref name=MWDC/> The Millbourne community is divided into two smaller communities named North Millbourne and Leefield.&lt;ref name=EFCL/>\n*[[Lee Ridge, Edmonton|Lee Ridge]] (within Leefield)\n*[[Michaels Park, Edmonton|Michaels Park]] (within North Millbourne)\n*[[Richfield, Edmonton|Richfield]] (within Leefield)\n*[[Tweddle Place, Edmonton|Tweddle Place]] (within North Millbourne)\n",{"template":{"target":{"wt":"col-3","href":"./Template:Col-3"},"params":{},"i":5}},"\n\n==== Millhurst ====\n",{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Main article","href":"./Template:Main_article"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Millhurst, Edmonton"}},"i":6}},"\nThe Millhurst community comprises the following two neighbourhoods in the south portion of Mill Woods bounded by 66 Street to the west, 23 Avenue to the north, 50 Street to the east and Anthony Henday Drive to the south.&lt;ref name=wardsnbhds/>&lt;ref name=MWDC/>&lt;ref name=EFCL/>\n*[[Meyokumin, Edmonton|Meyokumin]]\n*[[Sakaw, Edmonton|Sakaw]]\n",{"template":{"target":{"wt":"col-end","href":"./Template:Col-end"},"params":{},"i":7}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1216972533" about="#mwt347" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Col-begin/styles.css"}}'/></span><div about="#mwt346" id="mwAuY">
