<p id="mwA5s">Riverbend is located in the northwest portion of Edmonton's southwest sector.<sup about="#mwt450" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-28" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwA5w"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA50"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA54">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA58">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt453" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-RiverbendASP_43-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"RiverbendASP"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-RiverbendASP-43"}}'><a href="#cite_note-RiverbendASP-43" id="mwA6A"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA6E"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA6I">[</span>43<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA6M">]</span></span></a></sup> The area is bounded by the North Saskatchewan River valley to the west and north, Whitemud Creek to the east and a power line right-of-way at approximately 30 Avenue to the south.<sup about="#mwt454" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-RiverbendASP_43-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"RiverbendASP"}}'><a href="#cite_note-RiverbendASP-43" id="mwA6Q"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA6U"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA6Y">[</span>43<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA6c">]</span></span></a></sup> The following nine neighbourhoods comprise Riverbend.<sup about="#mwt455" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-39" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwA6g"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA6k"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA6o">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA6s">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
