<p id="mwA8M">Windermere is located in the southwest portion of Edmonton's southwest sector.<sup about="#mwt477" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-30" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwA8Q"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA8U"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA8Y">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA8c">]</span></span></a></sup> The area is bounded by the North Saskatchewan River valley to the west, Anthony Henday Drive (Highway 216) to the north, Whitemud Creek to the east and 41 Avenue SW to the south.<sup about="#mwt480" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-WindermereASP_45-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"WindermereASP"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-WindermereASP-45"}}'><a href="#cite_note-WindermereASP-45" id="mwA8g"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA8k"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA8o">[</span>45<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA8s">]</span></span></a></sup> The following six neighbourhoods comprise Windermere.<sup about="#mwt481" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-41" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwA8w"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA80"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA84">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA88">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
