<p id="mwA-c">The Grange is located in the west-central portion of Edmonton's west sector.<sup about="#mwt496" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-32" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwA-g"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA-k"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA-o">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA-s">]</span></span></a></sup> The area is bounded by 215 Street (Winterburn Road) to the west, Whitemud Drive to the north, Anthony Henday Drive (Highway 216) to the east and a combination of 45 Avenue and Lessard Road to the south.<sup about="#mwt499" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-GrangeASP_47-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"GrangeASP"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-GrangeASP-47"}}'><a href="#cite_note-GrangeASP-47" id="mwA-w"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA-0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA-4">[</span>47<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA-8">]</span></span></a></sup> The following three neighbourhoods comprise The Grange.<sup about="#mwt500" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-43" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwA_A"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA_E"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA_I">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA_M">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
