<p id="mwA_k">Lewis Farms is located in the northwest portion of Edmonton's west sector.<sup about="#mwt509" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-33" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwA_o"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA_s"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA_w">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA_0">]</span></span></a></sup> The area is bounded by 231 Street to the west, Stony Plain Road (Highway 16A) to the north, Anthony Henday Drive (Highway 216) to the east and Whitemud Drive to the south.<sup about="#mwt512" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-LFASP_48-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"LFASP"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-LFASP-48"}}'><a href="#cite_note-LFASP-48" id="mwA_4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA_8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBAA">[</span>48<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBAE">]</span></span></a></sup> The following seven neighbourhoods comprise Lewis Farms.<sup about="#mwt513" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-44" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwBAI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBAM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBAQ">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBAU">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
