<p id="mwBAs">Riverview is located in the south portion of Edmonton's west sector.<sup about="#mwt522" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-34" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwBAw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBA0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBA4">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBA8">]</span></span></a></sup> The area is bounded by 33 Avenue SW to the south, 215 Street (Winterburn Road) to the west, the Wedgewood Ravine to the north, Anthony Henday Drive (Highway 216) to the northeast, and the North Saskatchewan River to the east.<sup about="#mwt525" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-RVASP_49-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"RVASP"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-RVASP-49"}}'><a href="#cite_note-RVASP-49" id="mwBBA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBBE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBBI">[</span>49<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBBM">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
