<p id="mwBBk">West Jasper Place is located in the east portion of Edmonton's west sector.<sup about="#mwt534" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-35" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwBBo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBBs"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBBw">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBB0">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt535" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Plans_19-8" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Plans"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Plans-19" id="mwBB4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBB8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBCA">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBCE">]</span></span></a></sup> The area is bounded by Anthony Henday Drive (Highway 216) to the west, 100 Avenue to the north, 170 Street to the east and the North Saskatchewan River valley and ravine system to the southeast and south.<sup about="#mwt538" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-WJPOP_50-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"WJPOP"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-WJPOP-50"}}'><a href="#cite_note-WJPOP-50" id="mwBCI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBCM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBCQ">[</span>50<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBCU">]</span></span></a></sup> The following 17 neighbourhoods comprise West Jasper Place.<sup about="#mwt539" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-45" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwBCY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBCc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBCg">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBCk">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
