<p id="mwBC0">Other neighbourhoods within Edmonton's west sector not within larger residential areas include <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cameron_Heights,_Edmonton" title="Cameron Heights, Edmonton" id="mwBC4">Cameron Heights</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edgemont,_Edmonton" title="Edgemont, Edmonton" id="mwBC8">Edgemont</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Place_LaRue,_Edmonton" title="Place LaRue, Edmonton" id="mwBDA">Place LaRue</a> and Rural West.<sup about="#mwt547" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-36" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwBDE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBDI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBDM">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBDQ">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt548" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-46" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwBDU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBDY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBDc">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBDg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="57" id="mwBDk" aria-labelledby="Industrial_districts"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Industrial_districts">Industrial districts</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_neighbourhoods_in_Edmonton&amp;action=edit&amp;section=57" title="Edit section: Industrial districts"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwBDo">Four distinct industrial districts are located within Edmonton – the Edmonton Energy and Technology Park, Northeast Industrial, Northwest Industrial and South Industrial.<sup about="#mwt551" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-IndDistricts_51-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"IndDistricts"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-IndDistricts-51"}}'><a href="#cite_note-IndDistricts-51" id="mwBDs"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBDw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBD0">[</span>51<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBD4">]</span></span></a></sup> The Northeast District, Northwest District and South District are each divided into smaller industrial neighbourhoods.<sup about="#mwt552" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-47" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwBD8"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBEA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBEE">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBEI">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt553" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-IndDistricts_51-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"IndDistricts"}}'><a href="#cite_note-IndDistricts-51" id="mwBEM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBEQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBEU">[</span>51<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBEY">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<section data-mw-section-id="58" id="mwBEc" aria-labelledby="Edmonton_Energy_and_Technology_Park"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Edmonton_Energy_and_Technology_Park">Edmonton Energy and Technology Park</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_neighbourhoods_in_Edmonton&amp;action=edit&amp;section=58" title="Edit section: Edmonton Energy and Technology Park"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwBEg">The Edmonton Energy and Technology Park (EETP) is located in the northern portion of Edmonton's northeast sector.<sup about="#mwt554" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-37" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwBEk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBEo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBEs">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBEw">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt555" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Plans_19-9" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Plans"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Plans-19" id="mwBE0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBE4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBE8">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBFA">]</span></span></a></sup> The EETP is bounded by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canadian_Forces_Base_Edmonton" title="Canadian Forces Base Edmonton" class="mw-redirect" id="mwBFE">Canadian Forces Base Edmonton</a> to the west, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alberta_Highway_37" title="Alberta Highway 37" id="mwBFI">Highway 37</a> to the north, 33 Street NE (Range Road 231) to the east, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manning_Drive" title="Manning Drive" class="mw-redirect" id="mwBFM">Manning Drive</a> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alberta_Highway_15" title="Alberta Highway 15" id="mwBFQ">Highway 15</a>) to the southeast and Anthony Henday Drive to the south.<sup about="#mwt556" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Plans_19-10" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Plans"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Plans-19" id="mwBFU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBFY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBFc">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBFg">]</span></span></a></sup> The EETP forms part of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alberta's_Industrial_Heartland" title="Alberta's Industrial Heartland" id="mwBFk">Alberta's Industrial Heartland</a>.<sup about="#mwt559" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-52" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-52"}}'><a href="#cite_note-52" id="mwBFo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBFs"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBFw">[</span>52<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBF0">]</span></span></a></sup> The EETP is wholly within Edmonton's Rural North East North Sturgeon neighbourhood and is not yet divided into smaller industrial neighbourhoods.<sup about="#mwt560" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-48" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwBF4"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBF8"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBGA">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBGE">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt561" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Plans_19-11" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Plans"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Plans-19" id="mwBGI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBGM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBGQ">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBGU">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="59" id="mwBGY" aria-labelledby="Northeast_Industrial"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Northeast_Industrial">Northeast Industrial</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=List_of_neighbourhoods_in_Edmonton&amp;action=edit&amp;section=59" title="Edit section: Northeast Industrial"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwBGc">Industrial neighbourhoods within Edmonton's Northeast Industrial District include the following,<sup about="#mwt562" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-wardsnbhds_5-49" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"wardsnbhds"}}'><a href="#cite_note-wardsnbhds-5" id="mwBGg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBGk"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBGo">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBGs">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt565" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-IndLand_53-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"IndLand"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-IndLand-53"}}'><a href="#cite_note-IndLand-53" id="mwBGw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBG0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBG4">[</span>53<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBG8">]</span></span></a></sup> with their relevant city sector indicated in parentheses.<sup about="#mwt566" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sectors_1-38" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sectors"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sectors-1" id="mwBHA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBHE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBHI">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBHM">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt567" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBHQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"col-begin","href":"./Template:Col-begin"},"params":{},"i":0}},"\n",{"template":{"target":{"wt":"col-3","href":"./Template:Col-3"},"params":{},"i":1}},"\n*Clover Bar Area (southeast), which includes the Aurum Energy Park&lt;ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.edmonton.ca/business_economy/documents/Clover_Bar_Aurum_Industrial.pdf |title=Clover Bar Area (Aurum) |publisher=City of Edmonton |date=October 2012 |access-date=2012-12-01 |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20130904143638/http://www.edmonton.ca/business_economy/documents/Clover_Bar_Aurum_Industrial.pdf |archive-date=2013-09-04}}&lt;/ref> (or Aurum Industrial Business Park)&lt;ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.edmonton.ca/city_government/documents/Aurum_Industrial_ASP_Consolidation.pdf |title=Aurum Industrial Business Park Area Structure Plan (Office Consolidation) |publisher=City of Edmonton |date=May 2009 |access-date=2012-12-01 |url-status=dead |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20120512132502/http://www.edmonton.ca/city_government/documents/Aurum_Industrial_ASP_Consolidation.pdf | archive-date=2012-05-12}}&lt;/ref>\n*Industrial Heights (northeast)\n",{"template":{"target":{"wt":"col-3","href":"./Template:Col-3"},"params":{},"i":2}},"\n*Kennedale Industrial (northeast)\n*Yellowhead Corridor East (mature area)\n",{"template":{"target":{"wt":"col-3","href":"./Template:Col-3"},"params":{},"i":3}},"\n*Yellowhead Corridor West (mature area)\n",{"template":{"target":{"wt":"col-end","href":"./Template:Col-end"},"params":{},"i":4}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1216972533" about="#mwt568" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Col-begin/styles.css"}}'/></span><div about="#mwt567" id="mwBHU">
<table class=" col-begin " role="presentation"> 

